From: Vladimir Panteleev <git@cy.md>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:11:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(microsoft): a calendar write answers with the times as
 written, in their zones

Graph heeds Prefer: outlook.timezone only in reads: POST and PATCH of an
event answer with the start and end given, in the zones given (as a real
tenant shows).
